//steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042270-1846018067925663","game_id":"steam-5042270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.1.2: Sushi Names on Order Tickets & Hungrier Customers","summary":"Thanks for playing the SUSHI PARADE demo! The demo has been updated to v0.1.2. Steam will update it for you automatically. Sushi names on order tickets A customer's order ticket now shows the name of the sushi they want, right alongside its picture. Look-alike sushi are easy to tell apart now. Customers eat more, and earn you more Customers now eat sushi more often You now earn more coins when a customer eats a plate (eating it yourself still earns a little more) Once you accept their order, cus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:18:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042270-1845383656383421","game_id":"steam-5042270","kind":"update","title":"Our Apologies and a Status Update on the Windows Issue","summary":"Since the demo launched on October 1, some players on Windows have been unable to control the game properly. I'm sorry for the trouble this is causing. I haven't found the cause yet and am still looking into it. I'm checking whether it depends on things like display scaling or the monitor setup, but I can't say that for sure. I can't promise when a fix will be ready, but I'll post updates here as I learn more. If you're stuck right nowTo close the game, choose 'Quit' from the game's icon in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:09:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383421","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042270-1845383656379612","game_id":"steam-5042270","kind":"announcement","title":"SUSHI PARADE Demo Out Now!","summary":"The demo for SUSHI PARADE — an idle overlay game where sushi drifts along the bottom of your desktop — is out now on Steam! ▶ Visit the demo store page What's in the Demo Play the opening part of the full game Try Lane Craft. There are limits, such as how many lanes you can make, but it works just like in the full game *Demo save data will not carry over to the full game. Events in October Steam Next Fest (October 19–26) DREAMSCAPE#5 — Saturday, October 24, Tokyo International Forum Hall E2 Toky","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T03:10:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379612","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042270-1844751498230577","game_id":"steam-5042270","kind":"announcement","title":"SUSHI PARADE Demo Launches October 1!","summary":"The demo for SUSHI PARADE — an idle overlay game where sushi drifts along the bottom of your desktop — launches on October 1, 2026 (JST)! ▶ Visit the demo store page What's in the Demo Play the opening part of the full game Try Lane Craft. There are limits, such as how many lanes you can make, but it works just like in the full game *Demo save data will not carry over to the full game. Events in October Steam Next Fest (October 19–26) DREAMSCAPE#5 — Saturday, October 24, Tokyo International Foru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T05:24:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:48Z"